		<description>
			Prague Dreamland Festival 2026 is a 3-day immersive fantasy-themed electronic music event set in the heart of Prague. Blending dream-world storytelling with spectacular stage design, large-scale visuals, daily fireworks, and top international &amp; local artists across EDM, House, Techno, Trance, Drum &amp; Bass and Hardstyle.
		</description>
